+ * are CC0: each brand's colour and 24×24 SVG path. A server gets a logo when
+ * its name, its URL's host or its arguments name the brand, in that order;
+ * the command itself (npx, docker, uvx) never counts, so
+ * `docker run ghcr.io/github/github-mcp-server` gets GitHub's.
+ */
